`benchmark.meta description: Spawns a burst of short allocating tasks before any of them runs, then collects their results.
`benchmark.meta timing: recommended
`benchmark.meta profiles: compile-timing

/core/channel

. count = 20000
. results SyncBufferedChannel'Int
for i in 0 .. < count
    do new
        . items = [i, i + 1, i + 2]
        results <- items[0] + items[2]

. checksum = 0
for i in 0 .. < count
    checksum += (<- results)!

-- "bench-result tasks/spawn-burst checksum=$checksum"
